   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the product rule, \\( g'(x) = f(x) + (x + 1) f'(x) \\), and differentiating again, \\( g''(x) = 2 f'(x) + (x + 1) f''(x) \\).",
         "mathjson": -6
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "At \\( x = 1 \\): \\( g(1) = 6 \\), \\( g'(1) = 5 \\), \\( g''(1) = -6 \\).",
         "mathjson": -6
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Divide by the factorials: the coefficients are \\( 6 \\), \\( 5 \\), and \\( \\frac{-6}{2!} = -3 \\).",
         "mathjson": -3
      },
